# ActiveSite UCSF ChimeraX Trajectory Visualization Script
open "complex.pdb"
open "traj.nc" format amber structureModel #1
coordset slider #1

# Styling: ribbon for protein, magenta ball/stick for ligand, yellow pseudobonds for hbonds
hide
cartoon
color #1 lightgray
show :AQ4 atoms
color :AQ4 magenta
style :AQ4 ball
hbonds :AQ4 reveal true makePseudobonds true color yellow radius 0.08
view :AQ4
clip off
lighting soft shadows false depthCue false
